<div class="flash-messages board-page-flash" aria-live="polite"><p :for={{kind, message} <- @flash} class={"flash #{kind}"}>{message}</p></div>
<div id="nook-ui" phx-hook="Whiteboard" phx-update="ignore">
<main id="landing">
  <header class="landing-nav"><a href="/" aria-label="Nook home"><img class="brand" src="/assets/nook-logo.png" alt="Nook"></a><Layouts.account_nav current_scope={@current_scope} /></header>
  <section class="welcome-home">
<section class="welcome"><div class="welcome-copy"><h1>Welcome to <span>Nook.</span></h1><p>Start a whiteboard for notes, sketches, and shared ideas.</p><div class="actions"><button class="primary" phx-click="create_board"><svg viewBox="0 0 20 20" fill="none" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M10 3v14M3 10h14"/></svg>New whiteboard</button><button id="join-open">Join a room</button></div><small :if={!@current_scope}>No account needed to start.</small></div><div class="welcome-visual"><div class="board" role="img" aria-label="Example whiteboard with notes, drawings, and connected ideas"><div class="board-head"><span>Game ideas</span><div class="avatars"><span>S</span><span>A</span></div></div><div class="board-canvas"><aside class="mini-rail" aria-hidden="true"><span><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path d="m6 3 12 10-6 1-3 7Z"/></svg></span><span><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path d="m5 17 1-4L17 2l4 4L10 17l-5 1ZM3 22c4-4 6 3 11-1"/></svg></span><span><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24"><rect x="4" y="4" width="16" height="16" rx="1"/></svg></span><span>T</span><span><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24"><circle cx="12" cy="12" r="8"/></svg></span></aside><svg class="board-art" viewBox="0 0 460 270"><defs><filter id="paper-shadow"><feDropShadow dx="0" dy="2" stdDeviation="2" flood-color="#281135" flood-opacity=".07"/></filter><marker id="arrow" markerWidth="7" markerHeight="7" refX="6" refY="3.5" orient="auto"><path d="m1 1 5 2.5L1 6" fill="none" stroke="#9d80b1" stroke-width="1.2"/></marker></defs><g transform="translate(36 26) rotate(-3)" filter="url(#paper-shadow)"><rect width="156" height="118" rx="1" fill="#eee3f7"/><text class="hand" x="17" y="34" font-size="17">Puzzle game</text><path d="M17 43h106" class="line"/><text x="18" y="69" font-size="11">A room with three doors.</text><text x="18" y="89" font-size="11">Only one way out?</text></g><path d="M201 85c36-15 47-15 74-5" class="line" marker-end="url(#arrow)"/><g transform="translate(287 43)"><rect width="128" height="65" rx="32.5" fill="#faf7fd" stroke="#a58ab8"/><text class="hand" x="35" y="39" font-size="18">Level 1</text><path d="m100-12 3-9m9 17 8-5" class="line"/></g><path d="M352 120c-2 36-23 39-47 51" class="line" marker-end="url(#arrow)"/><g transform="translate(230 163) rotate(3)"><rect width="163" height="91" rx="1" fill="#fff0bd" filter="url(#paper-shadow)"/><g stroke="#9e8857" fill="none" stroke-width="1"><rect x="14" y="17" width="9" height="9" rx="1"/><rect x="14" y="40" width="9" height="9" rx="1"/><rect x="14" y="63" width="9" height="9" rx="1"/></g><text x="33" y="25" font-size="11">Sketch a room</text><text x="33" y="48" font-size="11">Try the controls</text><text x="33" y="71" font-size="11">Playtest</text></g><path d="M45 211c8-20 14-26 29-19 15 6 24 6 34-6 11-12 26-12 40 3 13 14 23 8 39-8" class="line ink"/><text class="hand" x="58" y="244" font-size="13" fill="#9f84b4">Try a different path.</text></svg><div class="zoom">− &nbsp; 100% &nbsp; +</div></div></div><p class="board-note">Draw, add notes, and work together on the same board.</p></div></section>
    <section id="recent-boards" class="recent" hidden aria-labelledby="recent-title"><div class="recent-heading"><h2 id="recent-title">Recent boards</h2><a :if={@current_scope} href="/dashboard">View all</a></div><ul id="recent-list" class="recent-list"></ul></section>
    <footer><span>Quick boards expire after {@guest_days} days without activity.</span><button id="home-settings"><svg viewBox="0 0 20 20" aria-hidden="true"><path d="m8 2-1 2-3 1v3l-2 2 2 2v3l3 1 1 2h4l1-2 3-1v-3l2-2-2-2V5l-3-1-1-2Z"/><circle cx="10" cy="10" r="3"/></svg>Settings</button></footer>
  </section>
</main>
<main id="workspace" hidden>
  <section id="board-load-state" class="board-load-state" role="status" aria-live="polite" aria-busy="true" hidden><h2 id="load-title">Opening your board…</h2><p id="load-detail">Loading your saved board.</p><div id="load-actions" hidden><button class="primary" id="retry-load">Try again</button><a href="/">Back to home</a></div></section>
  <p id="connection-notice" class="connection-notice" role="status" hidden>Connection interrupted. You can keep editing; changes will sync when you reconnect.</p>
  <header class="app-header"><a class="logo-link" href="/" aria-label="Nook home"><img class="brand" src="/assets/nook-logo.png" alt="Nook"></a><span class="header-divider"></span><input id="board-title" aria-label="Board title" value="Untitled board" maxlength="120"><div class="history-controls" aria-label="Undo and redo"><button id="undo" disabled aria-label="Undo" title="Nothing to undo">↶</button><button id="redo" disabled aria-label="Redo" title="Nothing to redo">↷</button></div><span id="save-status" role="status">Connecting…</span><div class="header-right"><Layouts.account_nav current_scope={@current_scope} /><button id="collaborators" class="secondary" title="People in this room">1 here</button><span id="request-count" aria-live="polite"></span><button id="help" class="workspace-help" aria-haspopup="dialog">Help</button><button class="primary" id="share-button">Invite</button></div></header>
  <div id="access-message" hidden><h2>This board is unavailable.</h2><p id="access-reason"></p><a href="/dashboard">My boards</a> · <a href="/">Home</a></div>
  <div id="canvas" role="region" aria-keyshortcuts="Enter Escape Control+a Control+g" tabindex="0" aria-label="Whiteboard. Choose a tool, then click to place. Right-drag to pan. Drag empty space to select."><div id="world"><svg id="connections" aria-label="Connections"></svg><div id="elements"></div></div><div id="empty-hint" hidden aria-hidden="true"></div></div>
  <aside id="history-notice" class="history-notice" hidden><p id="history-feedback" role="status"></p><button id="history-dismiss" aria-label="Dismiss undo message">×</button></aside>
  <aside id="overlap-notice" class="overlap-notice" hidden><p role="status">This item grew into another item. You can move them apart; nothing was moved automatically.</p><button id="dismiss-overlap">Dismiss</button></aside>
  <aside id="selection-bar" hidden aria-label="Element options">
    <button id="custom-colors">Colors</button><button id="delete" title="Delete selected element">Delete</button><button id="more-options" aria-expanded="false" aria-controls="advanced-options">More options</button>
    <div id="advanced-options" class="advanced-options" hidden aria-label="More item options">
      <button id="select-underneath" hidden title="Temporarily hide this item and reveal its overlaps">Select underneath</button><button id="duplicate" title="Duplicate (Ctrl+D)">Duplicate</button><label id="font-size-control" hidden>Text size <input id="font-size" type="number" min="12" max="72" step="1" value="16" aria-label="Text size" /></label>      <label id="text-color-control" hidden>Text color <select id="text-color" aria-label="Text color"><option value="purple">Purple</option><option value="charcoal">Charcoal</option><option value="violet">Violet</option><option value="white">White</option></select></label>
      <label id="stroke-width-control" hidden>Ink width <input id="stroke-width" type="number" min="1" max="24" step="1" aria-label="Selected ink width" /></label><button id="change-shape" hidden>Change shape</button><button id="change-icon" hidden>Change icon</button><button id="lock-position">Lock position</button><button id="reset-ends" hidden>Reset connection ends</button><button id="fit-text" hidden>Fit height</button><button id="make-text-fit" hidden>Make text fit</button><button id="group">Group</button><button id="ungroup">Ungroup</button><button id="attach-file" hidden>Replace file</button><button id="download-file" hidden>Download file</button><button id="send-back" title="Send backward">Send backward</button><button id="bring-front" title="Bring forward">Bring forward</button>
      <span id="selection-count" role="status"></span>
    </div>
  </aside>
  <aside id="rotation-menu" class="context-panel" hidden aria-label="Rotation options"><label id="rotation-control">Angle <input id="rotation-degrees" type="number" step="1" aria-label="Rotation in degrees" />°</label><button id="rotation-done">Done</button></aside>
  <div id="tool-dock" aria-label="Creation tools">
  <button id="tools-toggle" aria-expanded="true" aria-controls="toolbar">Hide tools</button><span id="active-tool" hidden></span>
  <nav id="toolbar" aria-label="Whiteboard tools" aria-describedby="tool-hint"></nav>
  <button id="studio-settings-open" aria-label="Board settings" title="Settings">⚙</button>
  </div>
  <aside id="reveal-controls" hidden aria-label="Revealing covered items"><span id="reveal-count" role="status"></span><button id="finish-reveal">Show hidden items</button></aside>
  <aside id="icon-menu" class="visual-panel" hidden aria-label="Choose an icon"><p class="panel-title">Choose an icon</p><p>Arrow is a symbol; use Connect for attached lines. Document is a symbol; use File to upload.</p><div id="icon-results"></div><button id="close-icons">Close</button></aside>
  <aside id="color-menu" class="visual-panel" hidden aria-label="Choose colors"><label>Apply to <select id="color-target"><option value="color">Fill / icon / ink</option><option value="text_color">Text</option></select></label><div id="color-palette"></div><label>Custom color… <input id="color-wheel" type="color" value="#ad7bfa" /></label><button id="apply-color">Apply custom color</button><div id="recent-colors" aria-label="Recently used colors"></div><p id="color-warning" role="status"></p><button id="close-colors">Close</button></aside>
  <aside id="shape-menu" hidden aria-label="Choose a shape"><button data-shape="rectangle">▭<span>Rectangle</span></button><button data-shape="rounded">▢<span>Rounded</span></button><button data-shape="circle">○<span>Circle</span></button><button data-shape="triangle">△<span>Triangle</span></button><button data-shape="diamond">◇<span>Diamond</span></button></aside>
  <div class="zoom-controls"><button id="mode-select" aria-pressed="true" title="Drag empty space to select items">Select</button><button id="mode-hand" aria-pressed="false" title="Drag empty space to move your view">Hand</button><button id="navigation-settings-toggle" aria-label="Navigation settings" aria-expanded="false">⚙</button><div id="navigation-settings" hidden><label>Navigation device <select id="navigation-mode" aria-label="Navigation mode" title="Mouse: wheel zoom. Trackpad: two-finger pan and pinch zoom."><option value="mouse">Mouse</option><option value="trackpad">Trackpad</option></select></label><label><input id="snap-enabled" type="checkbox" checked /> Alignment guides and snapping (hold Alt to bypass)</label></div><button id="zoom-out" aria-label="Zoom out">−</button><button id="zoom-reset" title="Reset view">100%</button><button id="zoom-in" aria-label="Zoom in">+</button><span></span><button id="fit" title="Show everything" aria-label="Show everything">⌖</button></div>
  
</main>
<dialog id="room-dialog" aria-labelledby="room-dialog-title">
  <form method="dialog"><button class="dialog-close" aria-label="Close">×</button></form>
  <h2 id="room-dialog-title">Room</h2>
  <div class="room-share-fields">
    <div class="room-code-field"><div class="room-code-heading"><label for="room-code">Room code</label><label id="room-owner-controls" class="room-toggle" hidden><input id="room-open" type="checkbox"> Allow requests</label></div><div class="copy-row"><input id="room-code" readonly aria-label="Room code"><button class="secondary" id="copy-code">Copy</button></div></div>
    <div><label for="room-link">Invitation link</label><div class="copy-row"><input id="room-link" readonly placeholder="Preparing your link…" aria-label="Invitation link"><button class="primary" id="copy-link" disabled>Copy link</button></div></div>
  </div>
  <p class="room-hint">Code requests need approval. Links let people join directly.</p>
  <p id="invite-feedback" class="room-feedback" role="status" hidden></p>
  <section id="room-requests" class="room-waiting" hidden><h3>Waiting to join</h3><ul id="requests" aria-live="polite"></ul></section>
  <section class="room-people"><h3>People <span id="room-people-count">1</span></h3><ul id="participants" aria-live="polite"></ul></section>
  <form id="name-form" class="room-name-form" hidden><label for="participant-name">Your name</label><div class="copy-row"><input id="participant-name" maxlength="40" required autocomplete="nickname"><button class="secondary" type="submit">Save name</button></div></form>
  <details id="advanced-sharing" hidden><summary>Room settings</summary><div class="room-settings-body"><div class="invite-actions"><button :if={@board && @board["can_manage"]} class="secondary" id="create-invite">Replace invitation</button><button :if={@board && @board["can_manage"]} class="secondary" id="disable-sharing">Disable sharing</button></div><p>Replacing or disabling an invitation removes current guest access.</p></div></details>
</dialog>
<dialog id="sharing-confirm-dialog" aria-label="Confirm sharing change"><h2 id="sharing-confirm-title"></h2><p>Current guests will lose access. Their saved work stays on the board. You can invite them again afterward.</p><div class="invite-actions"><button class="secondary" id="sharing-cancel">Cancel</button><button class="primary" id="sharing-confirm">Continue</button></div></dialog>
<dialog id="join-dialog" aria-label="Join a room"><form id="join-form" phx-submit="join_room"><button class="dialog-close" type="button" id="close-join" aria-label="Close">×</button><div class="eyebrow">THERE’S ROOM FOR YOU</div><h2>Join a room</h2><p>Enter a room code or paste an invitation link.</p><label for="join-name">Your name</label><input id="join-name" name="name" maxlength="40" placeholder="Your name" autocomplete="nickname"><label for="join-code">Room code or link</label><input id="join-code" name="code" required autocomplete="off" placeholder="Paste a code or invitation link"><p id="join-error" role="alert"></p><button class="primary large" type="submit">Join room</button></form></dialog>
<dialog id="help-dialog" aria-label="Help"><form method="dialog"><button class="dialog-close" aria-label="Close">×</button></form><h2>Help</h2>  <aside :if={@board} class="board-lifecycle" aria-label="Board lifetime">
    <%= if @board["kind"] == "guest" do %>
      <span>Temporary board · Saved automatically · Expires after {@guest_days} days without activity</span>
      <button :if={@board["can_claim"]} id="claim-board" phx-click="claim_board">Keep this board</button>
      <a :if={@board["can_manage"] && !@current_scope} href={"/save/#{@code}"}>Keep this board — create an account</a>
    <% else %>
      <span>Permanent board · {if @board["sharing_active"], do: "shared with guests", else: "private"}</span>
    <% end %>
  </aside>
<button id="name-board" class="name-board" hidden title="Give this board a name so you can find it later">Name this board</button><section class="help-current-tool"><h3>Using the current tool</h3><p id="tool-hint">Drag a tool onto the board, or click it to place.</p></section><p>Drag a tool onto the canvas, or click it and then click to place. Click Shapes or Icons to choose a variant. Double-click empty canvas to start a text box. In Select mode, click written text to type. Drag any empty part of an item to move it; written text stays available for editing. Click without dragging to edit a card. Moving and resizing leave the item selected. With the keyboard, choose a tool, Tab to the canvas and press Enter to place it. New objects focus their editor automatically.</p><dl><dt>Draw</dt><dd>Choose Draw after Text. Pen keeps the path you draw, including when you pause or release. Highlighter adds translucent ink. Use favorite pens for quick color and size changes; More lets you save a favorite, optionally smooth ink while drawing, draw with touch, or group strokes with a box. Settings are remembered on this device. Cleanup only happens when you select ink and choose Clean up shape. Eraser offers Whole stroke or Precise erasing; one gesture is one undoable action. Locked ink is protected. Escape cancels an unfinished gesture, then returns to Select. Lasso selects whole ink strokes inside a freehand loop. Right-drag pans; P, H, E, and L switch ink tools while Draw is active. More options on selected ink lets you adjust its width.</dd><dt>Undo / Redo</dt><dd>Use the arrow buttons or Ctrl / ⌘ + Z and Ctrl / ⌘ + Shift + Z. Your last 50 actions are kept in this tab, including through refresh. Offline undo changes are checked and synced when you reconnect.</dd><dt>Images and files</dt><dd>Copy an image, then paste it onto the board with Ctrl / ⌘ + V. You can also use File or drag files onto the canvas. Pictures display without captions or download links. Select a file or picture, open More options, and choose Download file to save it.</dd><dt>Workspace tools</dt><dd>Hide tools frees canvas space; Tools reopens the toolbar. Right-click any item to open More options. For shapes, choose Change shape. Icons are visual symbols; File uploads real files.</dd><dt>Colors and alignment</dt><dd>Colors offers a palette and custom picker. Navigation settings controls alignment guides and snapping; hold Alt to bypass snapping. Lock position under More options prevents movement and manual resizing, while words remain editable.</dd><dt>Pan</dt><dd>Hand pans over items as well as empty space without editing them. You can also right-drag, Space + drag, middle mouse, or two-finger trackpad scroll</dd><dt>Zoom</dt><dd>Mouse wheel for fine zoom. Open Navigation settings and choose Trackpad for two-finger panning and pinch zoom.</dd><dt>Edit</dt><dd>Click written text to edit. Text and notes keep their width, wrap, and grow downward as needed. Finishing an edit or deleting words never shrinks them. Shapes resize only when you resize them. Enter adds an item in a checklist; Backspace removes an empty item.</dd><dt>Rotate</dt><dd>Text, notes, shapes, pictures, files, icons, tasks, drawings, and groups can rotate. Select an item or group and drag the circular-arrow handle above it. Clicking or grabbing this circle reveals the angle controls. Done hides the angle controls while leaving the circle available. Keep turning past 360°, or enter degrees in the selection bar. Hold Shift while dragging to snap to 15° steps. Attached connections follow their items. Unlock position before rotating.</dd><dt>Resize</dt><dd>Drag the selected element’s bottom-right handle</dd><dt>Connect</dt><dd>Choose Connect, press anywhere on an eligible object, drag to another eligible object, and release. Clicking two objects separately does not create a connection. Plain text must be grouped with another item before it can be connected. Drawings cannot be connected; use Lasso to select ink and Group to keep strokes together. Connection arrows follow their target automatically. Click near a line to select it; drag near either end onto another eligible object to reconnect it.</dd><dt>Select</dt><dd>Left-drag empty space for a selection box; Ctrl / ⌘-click adds or removes objects. Ctrl / ⌘ + A selects all. Drag an icon from its center or edges. For covered items, select the cover and choose Select underneath. It disappears only in your view. Click an outlined item or its label, then drag blank space or edit its text. The cover stays hidden while that item remains selected, including during editing and dragging. Click empty canvas or select a different item to restore the cover automatically. Show hidden items or Escape also finishes the selection. Reveal deeper hides another cover. No saved layers change.</dd><dt>Group</dt><dd>Ctrl / ⌘ + G to group; Ctrl / ⌘ + Shift + G to ungroup</dd><dt>Nudge</dt><dd>Arrow keys move the selection; Shift moves ten pixels</dd><dt>Checklist order</dt><dd>Drag an item’s handle, or Ctrl / ⌘ + Up / Down while editing an item</dd><dt>Duplicate</dt><dd>Ctrl / ⌘ + D</dd><dt>Delete</dt><dd>Delete / Backspace</dd><dt>Cancel</dt><dd>Escape</dd></dl></dialog>
<dialog id="conflict-dialog" aria-labelledby="conflict-title"><div class="eyebrow">Unsaved change</div><h2 id="conflict-title">Review this change.</h2><p id="conflict-message"></p><div class="conflict-comparison"><section><h3>Current board</h3><pre id="conflict-current"></pre></section><section><h3>Your draft</h3><pre id="conflict-draft"></pre></section></div><div class="invite-actions"><button class="secondary" id="conflict-current-button">Use current board</button><button class="primary" id="conflict-keep">Keep my version</button></div></dialog>
<input type="file" id="file-input" hidden accept="image/*,.pdf,.txt,.md,.csv">
<div id="toast" role="status" hidden></div>
</div>
